# Line endings are LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# The Go SDK's CI gate is `gofmt -l`, which reports a file whose formatting
# differs from canonical — and CRLF differs.  Without this, a Windows runner
# checks the sources out with CRLF under the default core.autocrlf and the
# gate fails on every file at once, before any test runs.
* text=auto eol=lf
